### 🆕 Create Job + Booking (basic happy path)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/jobs-with-booking
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "SN-CRATE-0001",
  "model": "MODEL-ABC",
  "workcellId": 1,
  "vendorId": 1,
  "areaId": 1,
  "startDateTime": "2025-11-25T08:00:00.000Z",
  "endDateTime": "2025-11-25T10:00:00.000Z"
}

###

### 🆕 Create Job + Booking (no vendorId, still valid)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/jobs-with-booking
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "SN-CRATE-0002",
  "model": "MODEL-XYZ",
  "workcellId": 1,
  "areaId": 2,
  "startDateTime": "2025-11-26T13:00:00.000Z",
  "endDateTime": "2025-11-26T15:00:00.000Z"
}

